<p id="fs-id1167826092388" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167826092388" data-kind="translation"><strong>फलनाचे मूल्य शोधा</strong></p>
<p id="fs-id1167833386365" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167833386365" data-kind="translation">पुढील प्रश्नांत फलनाची ही मूल्ये काढा:</p>
<p id="fs-id1167833386368" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167833386368" data-kind="translation">ⓐ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833386368-1">f(−2)</span> ⓑ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833386368-2">f(3)</span> ⓒ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833386368-3">f(a).</span></p>
<section id="fs-id1167833396868" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167833396868" data-kind="translation"><h4>प्रश्न 14</h4>
<div id="fs-id1167833396870" class="problem"><p id="fs-id1167833396872"><span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833396872-1">f(x) = 3x−4</span></p><p><a href="#fs-id1167833309935">स्रोत-उत्तर पाहा</a></p></div>
<div id="fs-id1167833309935" class="solution"><h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5><p id="fs-id1167833309937">ⓐ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833309937-1">f(−2) = −10</span> ⓑ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833309937-2">f(3) = 5</span> ⓒ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833309937-3">f(a) = 3a−4</span></p><p><a href="#fs-id1167833396870">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a></p></div>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1167836606040" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836606040" data-kind="translation"><h4>प्रश्न 15</h4>
<div id="fs-id1167833272058" class="problem"><p id="fs-id1167833272060"><span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167833272060-1">f(x) = −2x+5</span></p></div>
<p data-kind="original" class="source-answer-missing">स्रोतात या प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिलेले नाही. स्वतः सोडवा.</p>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1167829720100" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167829720100" data-kind="translation"><h4>प्रश्न 16</h4>
