<div id="fs-id1167832951156" class="solution"><h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5><p id="fs-id1167829741589">ⓐ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167829741589-1">f(−2) = 20</span> ⓑ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167829741589-2">f(3) = 0</span> ⓒ <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167829741589-3">f(a) = a²−5a+6</span></p><p><a href="#fs-id1167829720102">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a></p></div>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1167836389935" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836389935" data-kind="translation"><h4>प्रश्न 17</h4>
<div id="fs-id1167824734626" class="problem"><p id="fs-id1167824734628"><span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167824734628-1">f(x) = 3x²−2x+1</span></p></div>
<p data-kind="original" class="source-answer-missing">स्रोतात या प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिलेले नाही. स्वतः सोडवा.</p>
</section>
<p id="fs-id1167836614042" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836614042" data-kind="translation">पुढील प्रश्नांत फलनाचे दिलेल्या ठिकाणचे मूल्य काढा.</p>
